WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:03.760
Another Thing That Doctor Bright Is&nbsp;
Not Allowed To Do At The Foundation:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:03.760 --> 00:00:08.880
He should not replace the buckshot in Dr.&nbsp;
Clef's shotgun shells with any of the following:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:12.480
birdseed, confetti, cake&nbsp;
sprinkles, sawdust, or glitter.

00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:14.960
Being a loose-cannon, ex-GOC operative,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:14.960 --> 00:00:18.960
it goes without saying that Dr. Clef loves&nbsp;
his shotgun, and during containment breaches,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:18.960 --> 00:00:23.280
he’s the first to charge in with said&nbsp;
shotgun and face down his anomalous enemies.

00:00:23.280 --> 00:00:27.120
However, as funny as Dr. Bright thinks&nbsp;
it may be, he really shouldn’t replace&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:27.120 --> 00:00:30.960
Dr. Clef’s buckshot with any number&nbsp;
of amusing, harmless alternatives.

00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:35.840
While seeing SCP-682 get a face full of&nbsp;
cake sprinkles certainly is something,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:35.840 --> 00:00:39.360
if Dr. Clef needs to spend another&nbsp;
week in traction as a result of it,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:39.360 --> 00:00:42.160
he’s going to have some&nbsp;
serious words for Dr. Bright.

